' uml_class_diagram.puml
'
' Simplified UML class diagram for the turtlebot3_drive executable, drawn to
' the unit's standard (Lec 2A): classes and their relationships only, with no
' member variables or functions, and the ROS classes our class relates to.
'
' Turtlebot3Drive is a Node (inheritance). It has a Publisher for the velocity
' command, a Subscription for the laser scan and a TimerBase for its update
' loop (composition): it creates all three in its constructor and they are
' destroyed with it.

@startuml
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam style strictuml
hide empty members

class Turtlebot3Drive
class "rclcpp::Node" as Node
class "rclcpp::Publisher" as Publisher
class "rclcpp::Subscription" as Subscription
class "rclcpp::TimerBase" as TimerBase

Turtlebot3Drive -up-|> Node
Publisher -up-* Turtlebot3Drive
Subscription -up-* Turtlebot3Drive
TimerBase -up-* Turtlebot3Drive
@enduml
